# Alias — do not regress Play stack

- Canonical branch: `redisign` (keep `master` equal to it).
- Ads: `community-admob-plus-cordova` + GMA **25.4.0** only. Never restore `admob-plus-cordova` / **20.6.0**.
- Keep `cordova-plugin-purchase` and product `alias_no_ads_6m`.
- Cordova Android **15.x**. Preserve `.github/workflows/android-play-release.yml` (eslint off, AAB verify, Play upload).
